TarisOS: the V/ISENSE capture stream is opened with one ALSA period per block of 'period' frames
(4096 on the J293), the block the main loop reads and the thermal model runs on. Without it
ALSA takes its smallest period (48 frames), and the blocking read of a block wakes at every one:
about 1,000 wakeups a second, and as many DMA interrupts, while sound plays. The model, its
limits, the read size and the unlock ping (once per block) are unchanged.

